# Folder structure

- Shared constants live in `src/config` (api-client, remotes, env, features). Do not duplicate them in modules.
- Domain code lives in `src/modules/<name>/` with a required `index.ts`.
- Do not add files at `src/` or a module root except `index.ts`. New code goes in `config/`, `api/`, `store/`, `ui/`, `pages/`, or `lib/`.
- Composition stays in `src/app`. Chrome stays in `modules/shell`.
- Cross-module production imports: `@/modules/<name>` or `@/config`.

```ts
import { REQUEST_TIMEOUT_MS } from '@/config/api-client';
import { useSession } from '@/modules/session';
```
